# @plurnk/plurnk-mimetypes operator defaults. The daemon composes these
# set-if-unset; an empty value is unset.

# PLURNK_MIMETYPES_SEARCH_EXCLUDE — comma-separated project-file path patterns
# naming content omitted from search derivations by the standard core file path.
# Content remains directly readable. Without `/`, match the basename; with `/`,
# match the full path. Uses body-matcher glob syntax; first match is the reason.
# There is no code fallback. #91 owns consolidating the current duplicate path.
PLURNK_MIMETYPES_SEARCH_EXCLUDE=*.min.*,*.map,package-lock.json,npm-shrinkwrap.json,packages.lock.json,yarn.lock,pnpm-lock.yaml,bun.lockb,Cargo.lock,poetry.lock,uv.lock,Pipfile.lock,Gemfile.lock,composer.lock,go.sum,flake.lock,gradle.lockfile,*/dist/*,dist/*,*/build/*,build/*,*/.next/*,.next/*,*/node_modules/*,node_modules/*,*/vendor/*,vendor/*,*/coverage/*,coverage/*,*/.vuepress/*,.vuepress/*,*/.nuxt/*,.nuxt/*
